# Original Wayfarer PRELIGHT comparison panels, dedicated to CC0 1.0.
# World X from negative to positive: black (no added light), red, white (fully prelit).
# Looking north (+Z), these appear white/red/black from screen left to right.
# Authoring units are 10 metres; all faces point toward -Z.
ModelBegin
ClumpBegin
TextureModes Lit
Surface 1 1 0
Color 1 1 1
Vertex -.9 .15 0 UV 0 0 #! prelight 0 0 0
Vertex -.9 .65 0 UV 0 1
Vertex -.32 .65 0 UV 1 1
Vertex -.32 .15 0 UV 1 0
Quad 1 2 3 4
VertexExt -.29 .15 0 UV 0 0 PRELIGHT 1 0 0
VertexExt -.29 .65 0 UV 0 1
VertexExt .29 .65 0 UV 1 1
VertexExt .29 .15 0 UV 1 0
Quad 5 6 7 8
Vertex .32 .15 0 PRELIGHT 1 1 1 UV 0 0
Vertex .32 .65 0 UV 0 1
Vertex .9 .65 0 UV 1 1
Vertex .9 .15 0 UV 1 0
Quad 9 10 11 12
ClumpEnd
ModelEnd
